Hi Levent,

I don't quite follow what you're asking. Could you describe what you mean by "preview the listening items  (paritcular 3 items) when audio is playing". mirtCAT has a number of inputs that are available in shiny, where you might for example have some lucky by defining a tabbed output for a given item presentation. There's not a ton of documentation about these inputs (long list of TODO's to create better documentation of the GUI elements), but you can find some worked examples here <https://github.com/philchalmers/mirtCAT/blob/main/tests/GUI-tests/GUI-tests.R>. Let me know if one of these is close to what you're aiming for.

Phil

